[05:50.33]M: And develop soft skills that machines lack, like emotional intelligence, critical thinking, and leadership. 
[05:57.71]Those are hard to automate. 
[05:59.89]Also technical skills like data analysis and machine learning basics help.
[06:05.15]W: Plus building a personal brand and professional network matters more than ever. 
[06:10.69]People who communicate their value clearly and showcase adaptability will have a distinct edge.
[06:17.42]M: Sounds solid. 
[06:18.79]So our structure is clear: survey data, jobs at risk like customer service and data entry, then strategies to stay relevant. Ready to practice the timing£¿
